runtime_text_sdf_grapheme_advance_mapping_validation_20260703

Scope:
- Added SDF advance projection for resolved layout advances that are defined per grapheme cluster.
- The current SDF path still bakes one glyph per Unicode scalar; this slice maps a grapheme cluster advance onto that char run as zero advances for cluster continuations and the sanitized cluster advance at the cluster end.
- Mixed native overlay fallback now accepts resolved grapheme advances and expands a failed SDF char to the full grapheme byte range before creating the native overlay batch.

